This repository contains a personal Alacritty + Zellij configuration derived
from and modified after an Omakub setup.

Omakub:
  https://github.com/basecamp/omakub

Omakub's README states that Omakub is released under the MIT License:
  https://github.com/basecamp/omakub#license

The local configuration in this repository has been modified for personal use,
including Zellij normal-first key bindings and standalone installation without
Nix, Home Manager, or sudo.

